<h2 style="color: #0F3725; margin-top: 0; font-weight: 800;">Security Alert: New Device Login</h2>
<p>Dear <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
<p>We noticed a login to your Go-Eat account (<strong><%= email %></strong>) from a new or unrecognized device:</p>

<div class="highlight-box" style="border-left-color: #EF4444; background-color: #FEF2F2; font-family: inherit;">
  <p style="margin: 6px 0;"><strong>Device / Browser:</strong> <%= deviceName || 'Unknown Device' %></p>
  <p style="margin: 6px 0;"><strong>IP Address:</strong> <%= ipAddress || 'Undisclosed' %></p>
  <p style="margin: 6px 0;"><strong>Timestamp:</strong> <%= timestamp %></p>
  <% if (locals.location) { %>
    <p style="margin: 6px 0;"><strong>Approximate Location:</strong> <%= location %></p>
  <% } %>
</div>

<p style="color: #111827; font-weight: 600;">Was this you?</p>
<p style="color: #4B5563; font-size: 13px;">If you recently signed in from this device, you can safely ignore this notification. Your account remains secure.</p>

<div style="background-color: #FFFBEB; border: 1px solid #FDE68A; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; margin: 18px 0;">
  <p style="margin: 0; color: #92400E; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;">Don't recognize this activity?</p>
  <p style="margin: 6px 0 0 0; color: #B45309; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5;">
    If you did not sign in from this device, your password may be compromised. Please reset your password immediately via the Go-Eat app or contact our security team at <a href="mailto:verify@goeatone.com" style="color: #0F3725; font-weight: bold;">verify@goeatone.com</a>.
  </p>
</div>
